[{"text": "I now give the floor to his excellency", "start": 0.8, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "Vipahv, chair of delegation of", "start": 2.879, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "Turkmanistan.", "start": 5.359, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. Pre, Mr. President,", "start": 26.4, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General, excellencies,", "start": 29.439, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "distinguished delegates, ladies and", "start": 32.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "gentlemen, first of all, I have the", "start": 34.64, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "honor to convey on behalf of the", "start": 37.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "president of Turkmanistan, his", "start": 39.28, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "excellency, Mr. Sardar Berd Muhammad of", "start": 41.36, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "greetings and wish of peace and", "start": 44.239, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "prosperity to the peoples of your", "start": 46.719, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "countries. Allow me to congratulate Mr.", "start": 49.36, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Khalil Rahman on his election as", "start": 53.039, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "president of the 81st session of the", "start": 55.52, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "United Nations General Assembly and to", "start": 57.28, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "wish every success in discharging these", "start": 59.92, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "important responsibilities.", "start": 63.039, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "I would also like to express our", "start": 65.199, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "appreciation to Miss Analina Berbok for", "start": 68.08, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "her leadership of the General Assembly", "start": 70.159, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "during its previous session.", "start": 72.32, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Distinguished participants, the current", "start": 74.88, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "international en environment requires", "start": 77.28, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "all states to demonstrate a high degree", "start": 79.28, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "of responsibility, political foresight", "start": 81.84, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "and readiness for concreted action.", "start": 84.799, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Rising conflict potential, the erosion", "start": 87.92, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "of trust, economic instability, climate", "start": 90.159, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "risks, and the rapid development of new", "start": 93.28, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "technologies are becoming increasingly", "start": 96.32, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "intertwined, directly affecting the", "start": 98.88, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "security and well-being of peoples. In", "start": 102.079, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "these circumstances,", "start": 104.799, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "it's particularly important to uphold", "start": 106.799, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "the common purposes enshrined in the", "start": 108.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "chart of the United Nations, ensure", "start": 111.04, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "respect for the sovereignty and", "start": 113.2, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "territorial integrity of states, the", "start": 115.2, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "sovereign equality and non-interference", "start": 117.759, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "in the internal affairs and strengthen", "start": 120.079, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "the rule of international law.", "start": 122.88, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "Turkmanistan firmly believes that the", "start": 125.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "United Nations must continue to serve as", "start": 127.759, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "the universal and legitimate foundation", "start": 130.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "of international cooperation and as the", "start": 133.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "principle mechanism for reconciling", "start": 135.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "interests and developing solutions in", "start": 138.56, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "the areas of peace, security and", "start": 140.959, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "sustainable development.", "start": 142.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "It's from this perspective that our", "start": 145.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "country approached the work of the 81st", "start": 147.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "session of the general assembly. Ladies", "start": 149.44, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "and gentlemen, ensuring international", "start": 152.16, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "peace and security remains a key", "start": 154.319, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "priority for Turkmanistan.", "start": 156.319, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "The permanent neutrality of our country,", "start": 158.4, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "recognized three times by the General", "start": 160.72, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "Assembly, provides a practical", "start": 162.72, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "foundation for advancing political and", "start": 164.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "diplomatic methods, preventive", "start": 166.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "diplomacy, mediation, and the peaceful", "start": 168.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "settlement of disputes. We consider it", "start": 171.12, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "essential to consistently foster a", "start": 174.08, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "culture of trust and dialogue and to", "start": 176.319, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "restore the legal and humanistic", "start": 178.48, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "foundations of international relations.", "start": 180.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "In this regard, Turkmanistan intend to", "start": 183.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "convene under the opices of the United", "start": 186.4, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Nations intergovernmental consultations", "start": 188.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "on the elaboration of a global peace", "start": 191.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "strategy founded on the principles of", "start": 194.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "peace, security and preventive", "start": 197.36, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "diplomacy.", "start": 199.519, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "As a further step in this direction, we", "start": 201.2, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "propose proclaiming a United Nations", "start": 203.2, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "decade of dialogue and preventive", "start": 205.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "diplomacy. We believe that such decade", "start": 207.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "which lend would lend a systematic", "start": 211.28, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "character to the efforts of states to", "start": 213.68, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "prevent conflicts, build trust and", "start": 215.76, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "establish sustainable channels of", "start": 218.319, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "political communication. Turkmanistan", "start": 220.159, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "will also propose the establishment", "start": 222.959, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "within the United Nations of a group of", "start": 225.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "friends of multilateralism and the", "start": 227.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "sovereign equality of states. Its", "start": 229.76, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "activities could contribute to", "start": 232.64, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "safeguarding the fundamental principles", "start": 234.159, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "of the charter of the United Nations,", "start": 236.319, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "strengthening dialogue among equals and", "start": 238.56, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "preventing the emergence of dividing", "start": 240.56, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "lines in international cooperation. We", "start": 242.239, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "attach particular importance to", "start": 245.439, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "supporting the United Nations Regional", "start": 247.28, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "Center for Preventive Diplomacy for", "start": 249.12, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "Central Asia headquartered in Ashkaba.", "start": 250.879, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "The year 2027 will mark the 20th", "start": 254.239, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "anniversary of its establishment. We", "start": 257.359, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "regard this milestone as a unique", "start": 259.919, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "opportunity to take stock of the cent's", "start": 262.479, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "work and identify new avenues for its", "start": 264.639, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "practical contribution to peace,", "start": 268.08, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "stability, and cooperation in Central", "start": 269.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Asia. To this end, during the current", "start": 271.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "session, Turkmanistan will submit a", "start": 275.36, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "further draft general assembly", "start": 277.199, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "resolution on the role of the regional", "start": 279.12, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "center. We trust that the document will", "start": 281.199, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "reaffirm our shared interest in further", "start": 283.919, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "strengthening its mandate and", "start": 286.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "operational capacity. In consistently", "start": 288.32, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "promoting education and scientific", "start": 291.84, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "cooperation as important pillars of", "start": 293.759, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "peaceuilding, Turkmanistan will continue", "start": 295.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "its engagement with the United Nations", "start": 298.32, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "on the initiative to establish a", "start": 300.96, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "university of peace and neutrality. As a", "start": 302.639, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "practical first step, we will begin", "start": 305.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "consultations on the establishment of an", "start": 308.08, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "academic center for peace, neutrality,", "start": 310.24, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "and preventive diplomacy at the", "start": 312.479, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Institute of International Relations of", "start": 314.639, "duration": 3.041}, {"text": "the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of", "start": 316.479, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "Turkmanistan. Distinguished", "start": 317.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "participants, digital transformation is", "start": 319.759, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "becoming an increasingly important", "start": 322.639, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "factor in sustainability and", "start": 324.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "development. Artificial intelligence", "start": 326.639, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "offers broad opportunities while also", "start": 329.44, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "requiring responsible international", "start": 331.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "governance to prevent its use and to", "start": 333.759, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "detriment of peace, security and trust.", "start": 336.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "In this regard, Turkman proposes the", "start": 340.16, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "development under the opices of the", "start": 342.96, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "United Nations of an international code", "start": 344.96, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "for the peaceful use of AI in", "start": 347.52, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "international relations and diplomacy.", "start": 349.759, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "To support this work, we propose", "start": 352.32, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "convening in Ashkabat an international", "start": 354.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "expert dialogue on digital trust and the", "start": 356.639, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "responsible use of AI.", "start": 359.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, peace and", "start": 361.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "development are inextricably linked for", "start": 364.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Turkmanistan. A key priority in this", "start": 367.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "area is the development of sustainable,", "start": 369.759, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "safe and inclusive transport systems.", "start": 372.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The proclamation at the initiative for", "start": 375.919, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Turkmanistan of the United Nations", "start": 378.16, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "decade of sustainable transport for 2026", "start": 379.84, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "2035 has launched an important mechanism", "start": 382.8, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "for systematic work coordinated by the", "start": 386.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "United Nations Department of Economic", "start": 388.479, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "and Social Affairs to put into practice", "start": 390.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "the decay implementation plan within the", "start": 392.88, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "framework of this long-term undertaking.", "start": 395.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Our country will continue its work", "start": 398.639, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "toward the creation of a global atlas of", "start": 400.639, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "sustainable transport connectivity, a", "start": 403.199, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "comprehensive analytical and", "start": 405.919, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "international tool for accessing", "start": 407.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "progress, identifying infrastructure", "start": 410.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "gaps and coordinating international", "start": 412.0, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "efforts.", "start": 414.0, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "During the 81st session, Turkmanistan", "start": 415.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "will actively support the implementation", "start": 417.759, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "of the AAZA program of action for", "start": 419.84, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "landlock developing countries for the", "start": 422.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "decade 2024 2034", "start": 424.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and the AAZA political declaration. In", "start": 427.44, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "this context, we particularly welcome", "start": 430.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the election of Turkmanistan as a chair", "start": 432.96, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "of the group of landlock developing", "start": 435.52, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "countries for 2027 2028.", "start": 437.199, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "We regard the confidence placed in us as", "start": 441.28, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "both a greater responsibility and an", "start": 444.88, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "opportunity to work together with the", "start": 447.599, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "states of the group to give fresh", "start": 449.52, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "impetus to the practical implementation", "start": 451.759, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "of the AAZA program of action in such", "start": 454.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "priority areas as transport and energy", "start": 456.96, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "connectivity. We proceed from the need", "start": 459.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "to translate the agreements reached in", "start": 462.72, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "into concrete infrastructure, trade and", "start": 465.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "investment projects. We propose", "start": 468.319, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "considering the establishment in", "start": 471.199, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Turkmanistan under the opices of the", "start": 472.639, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "United Nations of international center", "start": 475.12, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "for sustainable trade logistics and", "start": 477.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "custom cooperation. Such a center could", "start": 479.52, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "serve as a practical platform for", "start": 482.56, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "harmonizing procedures, exchanging best", "start": 484.639, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "practices, digitalizing transit and", "start": 487.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "expanding developing countries access to", "start": 489.84, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "global markets. Our country also", "start": 492.16, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "proposes the establishment under the", "start": 494.8, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "opices of the United Nation of trans", "start": 497.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "regional transport corridor linking", "start": 500.08, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "south and central Asia with Europe", "start": 503.199, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "through the Caspian Sea middle corridor.", "start": 505.599, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "We are confident that its development", "start": 508.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "would help diversify roots, strengthen", "start": 511.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "connectivity, expand trade and promote", "start": 514.32, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "close economic ties among the regions.", "start": 516.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Excellencies, distinguished delegates,", "start": 519.599, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "environmental security, climate change", "start": 522.8, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "and the sustainable use of energy", "start": 525.44, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "resources are integral components of", "start": 527.2, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "common security. In this area,", "start": 529.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "Turkmanistan will continue to promote", "start": 531.839, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "multilateral dialogue by proposing the", "start": 534.399, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "establishment of the Ashkabat climate", "start": 536.64, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "dialogue, an open multilateral platform", "start": 538.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "for regular political and expert", "start": 542.08, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "engagement, the advancement of practical", "start": 544.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "climate initiatives, and the", "start": 546.959, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "strengthening of international", "start": 549.2, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "relationships. We believe particular", "start": 550.8, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "attention must be paid to strengthening", "start": 553.6, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "the climate resilience of regions", "start": 555.279, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "severally affected by drought and water", "start": 557.68, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "scarcity. This requires", "start": 560.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "coordinated solutions combining modern", "start": 563.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "technologies, financing, data exchange", "start": 566.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and regional cooperation. In pursuance", "start": 569.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "of the general assembly resolution", "start": 571.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "entitled key role of reliable and stable", "start": 574.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "energy connectivity in ensuring", "start": 577.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "sustainable development, Turkmanistan", "start": 579.839, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "will continue consultations in", "start": 582.24, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "preparation for the high level forum on", "start": 584.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "sustainable energy for all. We view the", "start": 586.64, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "forum as an effective platform for", "start": 589.839, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "developing practical approach to", "start": 591.92, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "ensuring a reliable, affordable and", "start": 594.0, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "sustainable energy supply. In the social", "start": 596.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "economic sphere, Turkmanistan will", "start": 599.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "continue its active and responsible work", "start": 601.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "at a member of the United Nations", "start": 604.0, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "Economic and Social Council for the", "start": 606.0, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "period 2026 2028", "start": 607.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "as well as its constructive engagement", "start": 611.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "in the work of the council's subsidiary", "start": 613.519, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "bodies.", "start": 616.24, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, Turkmanistan", "start": 617.839, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "attached great importance to the", "start": 620.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "humanitarian dimension of international", "start": 622.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "cooperation. Lasting peace is impossible", "start": 624.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "without the full participation of women", "start": 626.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "and young people. The preservation of", "start": 629.12, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "human dignity, mutual respect, and equal", "start": 631.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "opportunities. Our country will continue", "start": 634.399, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "to advance the women and peace and", "start": 636.959, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "security agenda including by developing", "start": 639.36, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "the central Asian women's dialogue and", "start": 641.76, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "expanding its cooperation within the", "start": 644.079, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "United Nations peace buildingilding", "start": 646.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "commission and UN women. At the same", "start": 647.519, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "time, we will support the activities of", "start": 650.56, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "the Central Asian youth dialogue and", "start": 652.64, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "promote the broader and more meaningful", "start": 655.04, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "participation of young people in", "start": 656.959, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "international and regional peace", "start": 659.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "initiatives in accordance with the youth", "start": 660.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "and peace and security agenda.", "start": 663.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Distinguished participants, Turkmanistan", "start": 666.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "regards the strengthening of", "start": 668.56, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "international law as an essential", "start": 670.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "condition for a just and sustainable", "start": 672.64, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "international order. We welcome the", "start": 674.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "consensus adoption of the general", "start": 677.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "assembly resolution initiated by our", "start": 679.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "country proclaiming 2028 the", "start": 681.92, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "international year of law. As a part of", "start": 684.72, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "the preparatory process, we propose", "start": 687.519, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "convening in Turkmanistan in 2027 an", "start": 690.079, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "international forum devoted to the inter", "start": 693.12, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "relationship between international law,", "start": 696.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "disarmament, neutrality, preventive", "start": 699.279, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "diplomacy and sustainable development.", "start": 701.76, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "We believe that the forum will help", "start": 704.16, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "strengthen respect for the charter of", "start": 706.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "the United Nations, enhance the role of", "start": 708.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "legal mechanisms, and engage the younger", "start": 710.72, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "generation in the study and development", "start": 713.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "of international law. Mr. President, all", "start": 715.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "initiatives of Turkmanistan are united", "start": 720.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "by a common purpose to strengthen peace", "start": 722.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and trust, advance cooperation among", "start": 725.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "equals, and create the conditions for a", "start": 728.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "dignified future for present and", "start": 730.72, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "succeeding generations. We stand ready", "start": 733.519, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "to work with all member states, the", "start": 735.839, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "United Nations Secretariat, and", "start": 737.76, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "international partners toward the", "start": 739.839, "duration": 3.281}, {"text": "practical implementation of the", "start": 741.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "proposals outlined above. We are", "start": 743.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "confident that with political will,", "start": 746.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "mutual respect and commitment to", "start": 748.56, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "dialogue, the international community", "start": 750.399, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "can overcome existing differences and", "start": 752.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "achieve tangible progress towards the", "start": 755.279, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "purposes of the United Nations.", "start": 757.92, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Turkmanistan will continue to firmly", "start": 760.079, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "uphold the principles of permanent", "start": 761.92, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "neutrality, good neighborliness,", "start": 764.079, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "peacefulness and constructive", "start": 766.639, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "engagement, contributing to the", "start": 768.639, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "strengthening of the central role of the", "start": 770.639, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "United Nations in international affairs.", "start": 773.279, "duration": 6.521}, {"text": "I thank you for your attention.", "start": 775.92, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": ">> I thank the chair of delegation of", "start": 782.24, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "Turkmanistan.", "start": 784.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "I now give the floor uh to his", "start": 786.639, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "excellency Walter.", "start": 788.88, "duration": 3.12}]